      "lines": [
        "780. 证明下列命题的正确性：",
        "а) $\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}<3+4$；　б) $\\sqrt{10^2-6^2}>10-6$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "781",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "781. 计算：",
        "а) $\\sqrt{13^2-12^2}$；　б) $\\sqrt{313^2-312^2}$；",
        "в) $\\sqrt{17^2-8^2}$；　г) $\\sqrt{117^2-108^2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "782",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "782. 求下列各式的值：",
        "а) $\\sqrt{\\frac{25}{81}\\times\\frac{16}{49}\\times\\frac{196}{9}}$；　б) $\\sqrt{0.36\\times0.25\\times144}$；",
        "в) $\\sqrt{3\\frac{1}{16}\\times2\\frac{14}{25}}$；　г) $\\sqrt{5\\frac{1}{16}\\times2\\frac{34}{81}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "783",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "783. 把下列各式写成平方根的积：",
        "а) $\\sqrt{15}$；　б) $\\sqrt{21}$；　в) $\\sqrt{7a}$；　г) $\\sqrt{-3c}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "784",
